<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανίστημι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-στήσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>awaken, rouse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.13.9
			</span></i>; <i>raise up,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβάλλω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.669
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-στήσομαι,</span>
			<i>restore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2 and pf.
			
				Act.
			, <i>stand up, rise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1345a16
				</span></i>
			; <i>spring up</i> from ambush, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.74.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.59
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.596a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stand aloof from, depart from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.128
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>form factions,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ σπουδὰς ὀρχηστῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.487f
				</span></i>
			.</div>
